  "solution": "**Logic: Second no. = [{(First no. + 1) × 2} - 5]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**(1) **39 - 75 →\n\n⇒ [{(39 + 1) × 2} - 5]\n\n⇒ [(40 × 2) - 5]\n\n⇒ (80 - 5) = 75\n\n**(2)** 43 - 82 →\n\n⇒ [{(43 + 1) × 2} - **6**]\n\n⇒ [(44 × 2) - **6**]\n\n⇒ (88 - **6**) = 82\n\n**(3)** 55 - 107 →\n\n⇒ [{(55 + 1) × 2} - 5]\n\n⇒ [(56 × 2) - 5]\n\n⇒ (112 - 5) = 107\n\n**(4)** 64 - 125 →\n\n⇒ [{(64 + 1) × 2} - 5]\n\n⇒ [(65 × 2) - 5]\n\n⇒ (130 - 5) = 125\n\nHere,** '43 - 82'** is different from the rest.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".",
